---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../../components/PageHead.astro';
import Picture from '../../components/Picture.astro';
import EnquiryForm from '../../components/EnquiryForm.astro';
import { images } from '../../data/images';
---

<Base
  title="Care Homes"
  description="Maison Coiffure for care homes: gentle, personalised haircuts, styling and care treatments for residents in familiar surroundings, arranged with the care team. Request a quote."
>
  <PageHead
    eyebrow="For Businesses"
    title="Care Homes"
    lede="Gentle, personalised haircuts, styling and care treatments for residents, in familiar surroundings."
    crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'For Businesses' }, { label: 'Care Homes' }]}
  />

  <div class="wrap section">
    <div class="split" style="align-items: start;">
      <article class="prose">
        <p>
          For many residents, a haircut is about far more than hair. It is attention, touch and a
          moment that is entirely theirs. Maison Coiffure visits care homes, assisted-living
          settings and small residential communities, adapting each treatment to the person's needs
          and comfort, with time, respect and close coordination with the care team.
        </p>
        <p>
          Care can happen where it suits the resident best, including gentle haircuts and blow-dry
          styling at the bed or chair, scalp massage and hair care, and light styling for family
          visits or special occasions. Small haircare and self-care workshops for staff or family,
          hand care and a soft hand massage can be discussed as part of a visit.
        </p>

        <h2>Three ways to work together</h2>
        <p><strong>Individual treatments</strong>, arranged by a resident or their family.</p>
        <p><strong>Part-day visits</strong> for several residents, planned together with the care team.</p>
        <p><strong>Recurring visits</strong>, monthly or quarterly, so residents see a familiar face.</p>
        <p>
          Payment by family or institutional invoicing can both be discussed. A quiet space, a power
          socket and warm water are all the setup needs; the enquiry below asks about the practical
          details. Every arrangement is quoted personally.
        </p>
      </article>
      <div class="photo-frame" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;">
        <Picture image={images.greyLong} sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 45vw" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr style="margin-block: 48px;" />
    <EnquiryForm requestType="Care Home" heading="Request a care home quote" />
  </div>
</Base>
